#: tformmain.pcmain.tsformat.lblformathelp.caption
msgid "说明：扩展名统一转小写做目录名（.JPG 和 .jpg 同组），分组目录建在输出目录下；无扩展名文件进 _noext 目录；未列出的扩展名自动按自身扩展名建目录，映射表只负责合并与改名。"
msgstr "Note: extensions are lowercased as folder names (.JPG and .jpg are grouped together); grouping folders are created under the output folder; files without an extension go into _noext; unlisted extensions get their own folder — the mapping only merges and renames."

#: tformmain.pcmain.tsflatten.lblflattenhelp.caption
msgid "说明：把源目录（含子目录）中的文件移动/复制到输出目录顶层；输出目录默认为源目录（此时顶层已有文件保持不动）；重名冲突按顶部设置处理；重复执行是安全的（已到位的文件自动跳过）。"
msgstr "Note: files in the source folder (including subfolders) are moved/copied to the top level of the output folder; the output folder defaults to the source folder (existing top-level files stay untouched); name conflicts follow the settings at the top; running repeatedly is safe (files already in place are skipped)."

#: tformmain.pcmain.tsflatten.chkdelempty.caption
msgid "执行（移动）后删除已清空的子目录"
msgstr "Delete emptied subfolders after executing (move)"

#: tformmain.pcmain.tsregex.pnlregtools.btnruleup.caption
