msgstr "Move up"

#: tformmain.pcmain.tsregex.pnlregtools.btnruledown.caption
msgid "下移"
msgstr "Move down"

#: tformmain.pcmain.tsregex.pnlregopts.chkfullname.caption
msgid "匹配完整文件名（含扩展名）"
msgstr "Match full file name (with extension)"

#: tformmain.pcmain.tsregex.pnlregopts.chkignorecase.caption
msgid "忽略大小写"
msgstr "Ignore case"

#: tformmain.pcmain.tsregex.lblregexhelp.caption
msgid "说明：规则按列表顺序匹配，第一个命中的规则生效；未匹配的文件保持不动；目标目录名相对输出目录（可含子路径），留空 = 移到输出目录顶层。类 PCRE 语法。"
msgstr "Note: rules are matched in list order and the first match wins; unmatched files stay where they are; the target folder is relative to the output folder (may contain subpaths); empty = move to the output root. PCRE-like syntax."

